  "governing_issue": "DEN-1267",
  "notes": [
    "Public-safe registry. Immutable Slack channel IDs and Linear project UUIDs are deliberately excluded because this repository is public; they are recorded on DEN-1267.",
    "binding_state records whether the Linear project exposes a slackChannelId. Linear's ProjectUpdateInput has no slackChannelId field, so 'unbound' -> 'bound' is an operator action in the Linear Slack integration surface, not an API write.",
    "linear_notifications mirrors the writable Linear toggles slackNewIssue / slackIssueComments / slackIssueStatuses. All tracked projects already have all three enabled, so binding alone starts the event flow.",
    "channel_inventoried is false where the Linear project is confirmed but the Slack channel was not observed in the DEN-1267 inventory of 2026-07-27.",
    "#general (workspace-wide) is intentionally absent: it carries a portfolio routing index, not one-project event traffic."
  ],
  "schema_version": 1
